        <!-- Villains -->
        <section id="villains" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Villains</h2>
          <p>
            Villain responses include <code>books</code> and <code>shorts</code> arrays (instead of a <code>villains</code> array) linking to the works they appear in, a <code>residence</code> array linking to where they live, and their <code>type</code> and <code>kinds</code>. A <code>group</code> villain is a set of villains, such as a gang, a cult or a race.
          </p>

