        <!-- Places -->
        <section id="places" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Places</h2>
          <p>
            Places run from buildings up to towns, states, countries and other worlds. Each place links to its <code>parent</code>, the place it's in, and lists the <code>places</code> inside it, so Marsten House leads to Jerusalem's Lot, then Maine, then the United States. A place also links to the <code>books</code> and <code>shorts</code> set there and the <code>villains</code> who live there, counting anyone living in a place inside it: Kurt Barlow lives in the Marsten House, so Jerusalem's Lot and Maine list him too. Books, shorts and villains link back: a book lists its <code>places</code>, and a villain lists its <code>residence</code>.
          </p>

