        <!-- Types -->
        <section id="types" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Types</h2>
          <p>
            Every villain has a broad <code>type</code>: human, vampire, supernatural being, alien, machine or object, ghost, or animal. Under those sit <code>kinds</code> named in the stories themselves, such as Callahan's Type One vampires, the True Knot, and the machines of North Central Positronics. A type lists the kinds inside it and every villain of that type or one of its kinds, so the Vampire type includes the True Knot. A villain's <code>types_id</code> is the id of its broad type.
          </p>

          <!-- GET /api/types -->
          <div class="endpoint-card">
            <div class="endpoint-header">
              <span class="endpoint-method">GET</span>
              <span class="endpoint-path">/api/types</span>
            </div>
            <p>Returns all types, broad types first. Supports <a href="#pagination">pagination</a>.</p>
            <h4>Example Request</h4>
            <div class="docs-code-block">
              <code>GET <%= url %>/api/types?page=2&limit=1</code>
            </div>
